  {
   "text": "The Bloomburrow Starter Kit is a 2-Player Starter Set for Magic: The Gathering that was released on August 2, 2024.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "The Starter Kit is a learn-to-play product aimed at new players, including instructional materials that guide two players through their first game. Each deck contains multiple exclusive cards, headlined by a traditional foil mythic rare card.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Unlike Starter Kit 2023 and the Assassin's Creed Starter Kit , this Starter Kit is closely connected to a premier set .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 60-card preconstructed decks , including a foil card each",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "4 double-sided tokens (2 with each deck)",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 How-to-play guide booklet",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 double-sided reference cards (Turn Order/Attacking & Blocking)",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 Arena redemption cards for two people to unlock both decks to play online in MTG Arena.",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "As a gift-with-purchase, buyers receive a Bloomburrow sticker sheet.",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
